WEBVTT

00:00:00.294 --> 00:00:02.210
Lolly is a Production Studio

00:00:03.264 --> 00:00:05.059
Crossroads of civilization

00:00:05.758 --> 00:00:07.352
Refuge of all the arts

00:00:08.083 --> 00:00:09.968
Against the ravages of time

00:00:10.692 --> 00:00:12.195
Armoury of fearless truth

00:00:12.983 --> 00:00:14.430
Against whispering rumour

00:00:15.251 --> 00:00:16.995
Incessant trumpet of trade

00:00:18.103 --> 00:00:20.345
From this place ideas may fly abroad

00:00:21.106 --> 00:00:23.132
Not to perish on shores of change

00:00:23.908 --> 00:00:25.891
Not to vary with the writer's hand

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:29.684
But fixed in time, having been verified in

00:00:29.727 --> 00:00:30.369
proof

00:00:31.469 --> 00:00:33.483
Friend you behold a legacy honoured

00:00:34.259 --> 00:00:36.175
Lolly is a Production Studio
